{'symbol': 'PFG', 'date': '2021-08-18 09:00:00', 'title': 'PRINCIPAL® ANNOUNCES EXECUTIVE PROMOTIONS WITHIN CORPORATE FINANCE, U.S. INSURANCE SOLUTIONS', 'text': "DES MOINES, IOWA--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PRINCIPAL FINANCIAL GROUP® TODAY ANNOUNCED SENIOR MANAGEMENT PROMOTIONS WITHIN CORPORATE FINANCE AND U.S. INSURANCE SOLUTIONS (USIS). JOEL PITZ IS NAMED SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT AND CONTROLLER FOR PRINCIPAL®, EFFECTIVE NOVEMBER 15. IN THIS NEW ROLE, HE'LL HAVE LEADERSHIP RESPONSIBILITIES FOR CORPORATE ACCOUNTING, GLOBAL SOURCING, AND FINANCIAL REPORTING. PITZ PREVIOUSLY WAS VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER FOR PRINCIPAL INTERNATIONAL AND HAS HELD SEVERA"}